.DS_Store
._*
.AppleDouble/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Intentionally tracked: scripts, tests (including log fixtures), frozen prompts,
# researcher configuration/manifests, documentation and figure exports.
# This GitHub project is researcher-facing, never an experimental-agent workspace.
